+++ b/.changeset/cold-turn-tools.md
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+"eve": patch
+---
+
+Resolve tools for a fresh turn after a cold restart without first restoring tools from the completed turn. This fixes sessions whose next caller selects a different tool set, including scheduled reports, while retaining callback restoration for turns in progress and pending approval policies.
+
+Expose an explicit `defineDynamic` option for idempotent turn-scoped tool resolvers to restore missing callback bindings after cold recovery using the existing native rebind mechanism. Ordinary resolvers remain opted out.
